  "term": "CLES",
  "definition": "In this source, CLES refers to the Clinical Learning Environment, Supervision and Nurse Teacher scale, a measure used to assess factors in clinical learning environments. It is used to examine how features of the clinical training setting relate to nursing students’ clinical learning experiences and development of competence.",
